"The transpiled circuit still has six ECR gates, but the number of single-"
"qubit gates has reduced.\n"
msgstr "트랜스파일된 Circuit에는 여전히 6개의 ECR Gate가 있지만, 단일 qubit Gate의 수는 감소했습니다.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Repeat for optimization level 2:\n"
msgstr "최적화 레벨 2로 반복합니다:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/set-"
"optimization/extracted-outputs/77d76048-b1e8-4225-b35f-80dc9d458e8d-0.svg)\n"
